<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Specialty Care prices at $8.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Specialty Care prices at $8.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Specialty Care Network Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $8</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		 $8 - $9</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			3,177,544</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter		CS First Boston</p>
<p>NOTE: The company initially proposed 3.35 million shares for its planned initial public offering at a range of $9 to $11 but eventually proposed 3,177,544 shares at a range of $8 to $9.  </p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk (212) 859-1730</p>
